Darwin Gödel Machine (jennyzzt/dgm) at revision
a565fd2d1dca504ef5104a7cc0f3bdc4ab9b4fd2:
DGM_outer.py choose_selfimproves (score_prop / score_child_prop / random /
best parent selection: sigmoid(10 * (score - 0.5)) score weight times
1 / (1 + children_count) novelty weight), update_archive (keep_all /
keep_better with noise_leeway), initialize_run / dgm_metadata.jsonl
resume semantics, and utils/evo_utils.py is_compiled_self_improve
(eligibility) and get_model_patch_paths (lineage as an ordered ancestor
patch chain). Paper: "Darwin Gödel Machine: Open-Ended Evolution of
Self-Improving Agents", arXiv:2505.22954.
