Modified by MARS: durable SQLite archive with lineage DAG, frozen agent
manifests reproducible from a content-addressed harness snapshot plus
ordered patch chain, seeded deterministic selection, upstream `best`
ordering fixed to pick the highest scores, isolated candidate workspaces,
host-side tamper guard, held-out promotion gates, separate production
champion with rollback.
